  "description": "Customers Feedback: Conner M: \"The bike is solid , I've put alot of miles on it and its just a solid bike.\" Caney Valley Cyclist: \"About 600 miles and it's been great \" Guerector: \"Claris shifter shift great. ... shift very good for its price range...Pretty Good Deal...Comfortable and smooth\"\n\nNOW WITH POWERFUL DISC BRAKES! Think of this as a Kilo TT on steroids, a Kilo TT turbo-charged, sport SUV. With this Kilo GX R16 you know Wide Tires Fit up to 1.95\"x29 and 700x50c*. With rear braze-ons, you can rack it up and really haul.\n\nCustomers tell us this is one of the best ugly weather / winter-bikes you can possibly ride. Put on some 1.95\" x 29er tires and run over just about anything, anytime and anywhere.\n\nPlease Compare to Bianchi, Surly and other High Grade steel bikes at $1400+. Direct comparison to any high quality wide-tired, high grade steel bike will showcase the fantastic frame quality. At $699-699 delivered, there is no better value in it's class You'll have to look hard to try to find a magic riding, super durable, high grade steel bike with specs as good as the Kilo GX Series for even double the price.",
